<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Enhancement Shaman DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-enhancement-shaman-dps">Head for Enhancement Shaman DPS</h4>The best head option available are the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a> googles, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59456/deadly-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Deadly Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deadly Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56443/wildhammer-riding-helm">
<img alt="Wildhammer Riding Helm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_mail_dungeonmail_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wildhammer Riding Helm</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56298/renouncers-cowl">
<img alt="Renouncer's Cowl" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_mail_dungeonmail_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Renouncer's Cowl</span></a>, the <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4922/twilight-highlands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Twilight Highlands</span></a> reputation helms, or any of the normal versions of the heroic items listed are also great options.<br/>
