<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-enhancement-shaman-dps">Chest for Enhancement Shaman DPS</h4>The best chest option available is the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60318/cuirass-of-the-raging-elements">
<img alt="Cuirass of the Raging Elements" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_raidshaman_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cuirass of the Raging Elements</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>The <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a> chest, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56564/dragonkiller-tunic">
<img alt="Dragonkiller Tunic" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shirt_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonkiller Tunic</span></a>, or any of <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56281/wentletrap-vest">
<img alt="Wentletrap Vest" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_dungeonmail_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wentletrap Vest</span></a>, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58121/vest-of-the-true-companion">
<img alt="Vest of the True Companion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_dungeonmail_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vest of the True Companion</span></a> or any of the normal versions of the heroic items listed are also great options.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
