<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-enhancement-shaman-dps">Wrist for Enhancement Shaman DPS</h4>There are not many options for this slot, with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69549/wristguards-of-the-predator">
<img alt="Wristguards of the Predator" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_22b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wristguards of the Predator</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56340/elementium-scale-bracers">
<img alt="Elementium Scale Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Scale Bracers</span></a> being the best among them.<br/>
