<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Enhancement Shaman DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-enhancement-shaman-dps">Neck for Enhancement Shaman DPS</h4>The best neck option available, if your budget is high enough, is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67137/don-rodrigos-fabulous-necklace">
<img alt="Don Rodrigo's Fabulous Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea9.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Don Rodrigo's Fabulous Necklace</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56422/mouth-of-the-earth">
<img alt="Mouth of the Earth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea11.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mouth of the Earth</span></a>, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52350/brazen-elementium-medallion">
<img alt="Brazen Elementium Medallion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_50.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brazen Elementium Medallion</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56338/pendant-of-the-lightless-grotto">
<img alt="Pendant of the Lightless Grotto" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of the Lightless Grotto</span></a> or any of the normal versions of the heroic items listed are also great options.<div class="pad"></div>
