<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="relics-for-enhancement-shaman-dps">Relics for Enhancement Shaman DPS</h4>Relics are very straightforward in Cataclysm, they are just stat sticks that are universal across Paladin/<wbr/>Druid/<wbr/>Shaman. Most of them throughout the expansion come from vendors, but you can get some from dungeons and craft them with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=773/inscription">
<img alt="Inscription" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tradeskill01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscription</span></a>, also.<br/>
<br/>Keep in mind for the Valor purchasable relics, the overall stat gain is very low so despite the low price tag, you should generally hold off on buying it for as long as possible.<div class="pad"></div>
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c7" style="width: 10%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Rank</b></td>
<td data-background="c7" style="width: 25%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Item</b></td>
<td data-background="c7" style="width: 20%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Sockets</b></td>
<td data-background="c7" style="width: 23%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Source</b></td>
<td data-background="c7" style="width: 22%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Location</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Best</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64671/relic-of-golganneth">
